# spells out the scoring model, every event card by name, and the
# mechanics the site spends so much effort not revealing — see "What the
# site deliberately does not say" in the README. It was tracked here
# from the first commit and has been purged from history. It now lives
# at ~/Desktop/bta-design-doc/. Do not add it back.
beyond-the-algorithm-website-context.md

